<title>SWEDEN: Stora's Kopparkraft refinancing to up unit profit.</title>
<headline>Stora's Kopparkraft refinancing to up unit profit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry company Stora on Friday said it had refinanced consortium-owned Kopparkraft AB which will result in an improvement of 150 million crowns a year to the operating income of Stora Power.</p>
</text>
